    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "IMMEDIATE PAST PRESIDENT’S MESSAGE"
  }, {
    "type" : "image",
    "pdfua_tag" : "Figure",
    "id" : 7,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 90.0, 335.4, 224.4, 514.55 ],
    "alt_source" : "missing",
    "source" : "08c9eac4149a44cf8eed7cf1466ce8afa6b7_page_1_pg1_images/imageFile2.png"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 12,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 324.05, 404.398, 519.604, 525.706 ],
    "font" : "Times New Roman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "There have been a lot of changes in my life in the last two years, and I have decided to move from western Washington where I have lived all my life to Carlsbad, California. I have some family in the area and had met a friend there last year. She is a world traveler and an avid photographer. But the Northwest will always be my \"home\"."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 13,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 324.05, 321.578, 510.938, 387.706 ],
    "font" : "Times New Roman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "The travel bug is still with me having traveled to Europe, Africa, South America and Antarctica since we last met and with a few weeks in Southeast Asia scheduled for February."
  }, {
    "type" : "caption",
    "pdfua_tag" : "Caption",
    "id" : 9,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 90.024, 305.498, 197.652, 316.406 ],
    "linked content id" : 7,
    "font" : "Times New Roman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Dear OPCC members,"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 14,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 324.05, 238.778, 517.678, 304.886 ],
    "font" : "Times New Roman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "I will send Jim my email address once I get settled so we can keep in contact. Thanks again for the friendships and I wish all of you a Great Christmas and all the best in the New Year."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 10,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 90.024, 250.298, 266.82, 288.806 ],
    "font" : "Times New Roman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "My last five years as a member of OPCC have been very enjoyable and rewarding."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 11,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 90.024, 195.098, 276.998, 247.406 ],
    "font" : "Times New Roman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "I have met many talented people and have made many friends, and have learned more about photography than I had hoped for."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 15,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 324.05, 211.178, 389.57, 222.086 ],
